{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0008", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Chriſtus Iohannis Baptiſtæ teſtimonio Iudæis com-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "Christ had been commended to the Jews by the testimony of John the Baptist;", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0008"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 8}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0009", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "mendatus; quod quidem veriſſimum ampliſſimum-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "which testimony was indeed most true and most ample,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0009"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 9}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0010", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "q́ue fuit, nec à Iudæis ipſis contemni potuit, apud", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "and could not be despised even by the Jews themselves, among", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0010"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 10}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0011", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quos ſummo in honore Iohannes precioq́ue vixit.", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "whom John lived in the highest honour and esteem.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0011"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 11}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0012", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Hoc tamen Iohannis teſtimonio alia ſe Chriſtus ha-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "Yet Christ affirms that he has other witnesses beyond this testimony of John —", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0012"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 12}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0013", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "bere affirmat maiora, certiora, auguſtiora: eaq́; tria", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "greater, more certain, more august: and he mentions three of them.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0013"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 13}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0014", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "commemorat. Primum, opera, quæ fecit. Secundũ,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "First, the works which he did. Second,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0014"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 14}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0015", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "patrem ſuum, à quo miſſus fuit. Tertium, ſacras i-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "his Father, by whom he was sent. Third, the sacred", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0015"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 15}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0016", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "pſas Scripturas, quas teſtes ſuas vocat. Et quidem de", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "Scriptures themselves, which he calls his witnesses. And indeed", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0016"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 16}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0017", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Scripturis Iudæi honorificè ſentiebant, in iiſque vi-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "the Jews held an honourable opinion of the Scriptures, and hoped that in them", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0017"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 17}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0018", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "tam æternam inueniri poſſe ſperabant. Quod illo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "eternal life could be found. This judgement of theirs", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0018"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 18}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0019", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "rum de Scripturis iudicium Chriſtus minimè repre-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "concerning the Scriptures Christ in no way", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0019"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 19}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0020", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "hendit, ſed laudat potiùs, iubetq́ue vt pergant Scri-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "reproves, but rather praises, and commands them to go on searching the Scriptures,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0020"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 20}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0021", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "pturas ſcrutari, eorumque omnino erga Scripturas", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "and altogether inflames their zeal toward the Scriptures", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0021"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 21}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0022", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſtudium inflammat, induſtriamq́; acuit. Hortatur e-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "and sharpens their industry. For he exhorts them", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0022"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 22}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0023", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "nim vt Scripturas non legant modò, ſed ſcrutentur", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "not merely to read the Scriptures, but also to search them", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0023"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 23}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0024", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "etiam, penitusq́; excutiant : ita eos non tenui lectio-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "and thoroughly sift them: thus he wants them not to be content with a superficial reading,", "notes": "'tenui lectione' rendered as 'superficial reading' (Forcellini sense of tenuis = slight, scanty).", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0024"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 24}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0025", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ne contentos eſſe vult, ſed aſſiduam, acrem, labo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "but requires an assiduous, keen, laborious", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0025"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 25}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0026", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "rioſam inueſtigandi perſcrutandiq́; diligentiam re-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "diligence in investigating and thoroughly examining,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0026"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 26}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0027", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quirit, qualem illi adhibere ſolent, qui defoſſum in", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "such as those are accustomed to apply who most diligently seek a treasure buried in", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0027"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 27}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0028", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "terra theſaurum diligentiſſimè quærunt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "the earth,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0028"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 28}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0001", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Et quando Chriſtus ſine exceptione iuſſit ſcruta-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "And when Christ without exception commanded that the sacred Scriptures be searched,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0001"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 1}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0002", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ri ſacras Scripturas, nó has modò, aut illas, aut quaſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "not only these, or those, or certain ones,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0002"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 2}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0003", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "dam; manifeſtum eſt, his verbis præſcribi, vt vniuer-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "it is manifest that by these words it is prescribed that we should search them all,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0003"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 3}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0004", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſas ſcrutemur, non in certis Scripturarum partibus", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "not that, clinging to certain parts of the Scriptures,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0004"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 4}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0005", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "hærentes contemnamus aut prætermittamus reli-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "we should despise or pass over the rest.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0005"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 5}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0006", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quas. Omnes enim Chriſto non obſcurum teſtimo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "For all of them give no obscure testimony to Christ.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0006"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 6}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0007", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "nium dicunt. Scripturas autem & Papiſtæ celebrãt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "The Papists too celebrate the Scriptures,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0007"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 7}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0008", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "& nos in maximo precio habemus: & ſcrutandas eſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "and we hold them in the highest esteem; and that the Scriptures", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0008"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 8}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0009", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſe Scripturas à nobis nulla omnino controuerſia eſt:", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "must be searched is, on our side, no controversy at all:", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0009"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 9}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0010", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "verú de modo, quo eas ſcrutari oporteat, & ad quos", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "but concerning the manner in which they ought to be searched, and to whom", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0010"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 10}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0011", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ea cura ſpectet, déque ipſis Scripturis, quas ſcrutan-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "that care belongs, and concerning the Scriptures themselves which we", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0011"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 11}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0012", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "das eſſe ſumma conſenſione omnes affirmamus, eſt", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "all affirm with the fullest consent must be searched, there is", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0012"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 12}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0013", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "grauiſſima controuerſia, quam nunc explicare ag-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:23:41Z", "english": "a most weighty controversy, which we now undertake to set forth.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0013"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 13}
